iance to regulators, protecting both our certification timeline and market standing.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"Post-Market Log Analytics Monitoring Service\",\n\"what\": \"We stand up an internal analytics service that continuously ingests production logs from deployed high-risk systems and flags events matching the Article 12(2)(a) risk triggers, enabling early detection before a safety incident or substantial modification occurs.\",\n\"how\": \"A small data-engineering team builds a streaming pipeline that parses structured logs against configurable risk rules, producing weekly compliance dashboards for our monitoring function and automated alerts to engineering when thresholds are crossed.\",\n\"why\": \"This converts Article 12 from a passive documentation duty into an active early-warning capability, reducing incident liability and strengthening our surveillance narrative with regulators.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"Biometric Verification Logging Toolkit for Annex III\",\n\"what\": \"We develop a reusable logging-and-documentation toolkit specifically for biometric identification systems that captures the four minimum data elements required by Article 12(3): session start and end timestamps, reference database identifiers, matched input data, and verifier identities.\",\n\"how\": \"A product engineer pairs with our legal team to spec a modular SDK component that instruments each biometric pipeline stage and auto-generates audit-ready log entries formatted for regulatory submission without manual curation.\",\n\"why\": \"This turns a dense compliance obligation into a plug-and-build component, accelerating time-to-market for any Annex III 1(a) product we develop and cutting per-project legal overhead.\"\n}\n]\n}",
