ynchronization, and verifier-identity lookup against our SSO directory.\",\n\"why\": \"It converts a per-project two-week compliance task into a zero-marginal-cost import, preserving the prototyping velocity my team is measured on while guaranteeing every system ships with Article 12(3) fields already flowing.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"CI Gate That Fails Prototypes Missing Log Events\",\n\"what\": \"An automated test stage in our CI/CD pipeline that replays a canonical set of synthetic inputs through any candidate high-risk prototype and asserts that the expected log records—timestamps, database reference, match pairs, verifier ID—appear with correct structure and schema version before the build is allowed to advance.\",\n\"how\": \"We encode the Article 12(3) field list as a JSON Schema contract; the gate fires after unit tests pass and before integration deployment, using recorded replay fixtures so it runs in under ninety seconds and produces a human-readable diff when a field is absent or malformed.\",\n\"why\": \"Catching a missing log field at prototype hour eight instead of at pre-market compliance review prevents the expensive re-architecture cycle that would stall an entire project timeline.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"Lifetime Log Volume Feasibility Study Across Use Cases\",\n\"what\": \"A bounded technical pilot in which we instrument three representative high-risk prototypes (a biometric verification loop, a clinical triage assistant, and a credit-scoring model) with production-like query rates for six weeks to measure actual log throughput, storage growth curves, and compression ratios under the mandated field set.\",\n\"how\": \"Each prototype runs on identical hardware in our staging cluster; we capture raw and compressed byte counts per day, model the curve to a ten-year horizon using simple exponential regression, and produce a one-page sizing recommendation for our platform team so storage procurement is planned rather than reactive.\",\n\"why\": \"It answers the core technical-viability question—can our infrastructure sustain lifetime logging at scale?—with empirical data, de-risking the Lab Director's storage concern before we commit budget across the portfolio.\"\n}\n]\n}",
